sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Emitters
    participant Ing as Ingest
    participant Rec as Name reconciler
    participant St as Store
    participant Q as Query
    Src->>Ing: metrics under inconsistent names
    Ing->>Rec: raw name and labels
    Rec->>Rec: map to a canonical name, keep the alias
    Note over Rec: reconcile on ingest — rewriting history later is far more expensive
    Rec->>St: canonical series
    Q->>St: query by canonical name
    St-->>Q: one series, whatever the emitter called it
    Q->>Rec: query by an old alias
    Rec-->>Q: resolved, so dashboards do not break during a rename
